[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7381.55, "timestamp": "02:03:01", "text": "请告诉我这个问题。是啊，告诉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7384.87, "timestamp": "02:03:04", "text": "对我来说，那是三年级的水平。我得到了一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7387.43, "timestamp": "02:03:07", "text": "电脑之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7395.91, "timestamp": "02:03:15", "text": "嗯。退出是因为我没有得到我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7398.229, "timestamp": "02:03:18", "text": "我没有电脑。我叔叔得到了一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7401.51, "timestamp": "02:03:21", "text": "他有台电脑，所以教我怎么用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7405.669, "timestamp": "02:03:25", "text": "啊，在做了一些类似……之后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7408.229, "timestamp": "02:03:28", "text": "呃，就像我解释的那样，就像我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7409.75, "timestamp": "02:03:29", "text": "修好了一些东西，我做了一些类似的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7412.629, "timestamp": "02:03:32", "text": "其他一些副业。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7414.27, "timestamp": "02:03:34", "text": "有足够的钱买一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7424.87, "timestamp": "02:03:44", "text": "我当时正忙着处理一些事情，我们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7426.95, "timestamp": "02:03:46", "text": "就像BSNL的Wi-Fi设备那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7430.95, "timestamp": "02:03:50", "text": "慢，但也没那么慢。我的天哪。 VSL"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7433.109, "timestamp": "02:03:53", "text": "网络速度总是很慢。那是"}]